177
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:10,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got to help you too?</font>

178
00:07:10,330 --> 00:07:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like right now</font>

179
00:07:11,290 --> 00:07:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to figure myself out.</font>

180
00:07:12,610 --> 00:07:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. If she wants to...</font>

181
00:07:16,130 --> 00:07:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off. Bye.</font>

182
00:07:16,890 --> 00:07:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to rest, go ahead.</font>

183
00:07:20,010 --> 00:07:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

184
00:07:24,530 --> 00:07:25,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

185
00:07:35,090 --> 00:07:37,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watching her walk away,</font>

186
00:07:37,210 --> 00:07:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel pretty bad for her.</font>

187
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt really down.</font>

188
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so pink now.</font>

189
00:07:55,740 --> 00:07:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's beautiful.</font>

190
00:07:58,940 --> 00:07:59,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink sunset]</font>

191
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a gorgeous sunset. It's so pink!</font>

192
00:08:01,220 --> 00:08:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so, so, so pretty!</font>

193
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you wait a second?</font>

194
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

195
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's pink.</font>

196
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take pictures over there.</font>

197
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Annie?</font>

198
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No idea.</font>

199
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie's...</font>

200
00:08:12,780 --> 00:08:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie's on a date.</font>

201
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

202
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

203
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:18,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianqing</font>

204
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really made a move on Annie.</font>

205
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so pink. Look at that sky.</font>

206
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, hurry.</font>

207
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's gorgeous.</font>

208
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, so pretty.</font>

209
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I called you out right away.</font>

210
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:28,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good, right?</font>

211
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

212
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any later and we'd have missed it.</font>

213
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:31,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You actually thought of me for this? Nice.</font>

214
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a sunset. Hurry!</font>

215
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see how good it is.</font>

216
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's beautiful.</font>

217
00:08:40,300 --> 00:08:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously?</font>

218
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink sky]
It's purple.</font>

219
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Like a giant pink bubble over everyone]</font>

220
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So beautiful.</font>

221
00:08:53,540 --> 00:08:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Island of Affection glows softly]</font>

222
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

223
00:09:01,660 --> 00:09:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is stunning.</font>

224
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on!</font>

225
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's hold hands.</font>

226
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made up that pose myself.</font>

227
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You did?</font>

228
00:09:16,140 --> 00:09:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about my pose?</font>

229
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come up with your own.</font>

230
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is the sky pink?</font>

231
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, it's gorgeous.</font>

232
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're gorgeous too.</font>

233
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

234
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

235
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off to my date, then.</font>

236
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:30,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're prettier than the sunset.</font>

237
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

238
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off to my date, then.</font>

239
00:09:31,660 --> 00:09:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm having a good day.</font>

240
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, go ahead.</font>

241
00:09:32,980 --> 00:09:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm happy now. Go wherever you want.</font>

242
00:09:42,060 --> 00:09:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dizzy from spinning.</font>

243
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So pretty.</font>

244
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take a selfie.</font>

245
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, let's do it.</font>

246
00:09:51,380 --> 00:09:52,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

247
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How'd it go? Still having fun?</font>

248
00:09:54,460 --> 00:09:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

249
00:09:59,420 --> 00:10:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, are you feeling better?</font>

250
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My fever's gone down.</font>

251
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's low now.</font>

252
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing I always look grumpy.</font>

253
00:10:12,580 --> 00:10:13,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even when we're all together,</font>

254
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always look like this.</font>

255
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So nobody can tell the difference.</font>

256
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True. You've been very consistent.</font>

257
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you go.</font>

258
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True.</font>

259
00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Silence]</font>

260
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you sitting here for?</font>

261
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Waiting to play a game.</font>

262
00:10:40,780 --> 00:10:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we play now?</font>

263
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:43,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to play.</font>

264
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do it.</font>

265
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

266
00:10:47,460 --> 00:10:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi sits across from Wang Sheng]</font>

267
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still silent]</font>

268
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one. It's quicker.</font>

269
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't really think about how he'd feel.</font>

270
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just didn't ask him out.</font>

271
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought everyone could use</font>

272
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:19,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some time to cool off.</font>

273
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he said it himself.</font>

274
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He needed time.</font>

275
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I gave him time.</font>

276
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Breaks the silence]
Was it pretty down by the beach?</font>

277
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's prettier here, I think.</font>

278
00:11:31,700 --> 00:11:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was pretty foggy over there.</font>

279
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought we'd see the sunset,</font>

280
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you couldn't see it from there.</font>

281
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you tired?</font>

282
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Checks on her]
Are you tired?</font>

283
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You feeling tired?</font>

284
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

285
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm okay.</font>

286
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you have a lot to talk about?</font>

287
00:11:54,660 --> 00:11:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Quietly fishing for details]
Like days' worth of conversation?</font>

288
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With who? With...</font>

289
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao?</font>

290
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I spend days talking to him?</font>

291
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I mean</font>

292
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:05,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao would find a way</font>

293
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep teasing you</font>

294
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and chatting with you.</font>

295
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

296
00:12:10,260 --> 00:12:12,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's already lost his voice,</font>

297
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:14,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he's got back-to-back dates today.</font>

298
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll see how he's doing when he gets back.</font>

299
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't have that much to say to me.</font>

300
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't buy it.</font>

301
00:12:25,260 --> 00:12:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao</font>

302
00:12:25,540 --> 00:12:27,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always has plenty to say to everyone.</font>

303
00:12:27,900 --> 00:12:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was quick.</font>

304
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:29,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao Yuheng appears]</font>

305
00:12:29,540 --> 00:12:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is insane. I look so good.</font>

306
00:12:31,300 --> 00:12:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one I took of you?</font>

307
00:12:39,340 --> 00:12:41,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're taking selfies.</font>

308
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't I look good? Look at this one.</font>

309
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:43,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wow, you really look great.</font>

310
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So handsome.</font>

311
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this one.</font>

312
00:12:45,980 --> 00:12:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, that's enough.</font>

313
00:12:47,420 --> 00:12:49,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was a little upset.</font>

314
00:12:49,430 --> 00:12:50,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though I knew</font>

315
00:12:50,470 --> 00:12:51,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">roughly why she'd done it,</font>

316
00:12:51,590 --> 00:12:53,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sometimes I just...</font>

317
00:12:53,150 --> 00:12:54,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get insecure pretty easily.</font>

318
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:57,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure it showed.</font>

319
00:12:57,390 --> 00:12:59,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little upset]
Yeah, she could probably tell.</font>

320
00:13:06,950 --> 00:13:08,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er's back.</font>

321
00:13:08,630 --> 00:13:09,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er.</font>

322
00:13:10,110 --> 00:13:11,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't with this.</font>

323
00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:12,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

324
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:12,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

325
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:13,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dying.</font>

326
00:13:13,910 --> 00:13:15,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guess who I just saw.</font>

327
00:13:15,470 --> 00:13:15,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

328
00:13:15,990 --> 00:13:17,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie.</font>

329
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:18,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie asked you out?</font>

330
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:19,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie</font>

331
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:20,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asked Dong out.</font>

332
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:22,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't believe it]
The three of us.</font>

333
00:13:22,470 --> 00:13:23,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I left.</font>

334
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:24,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said I needed to cool off.</font>

335
00:13:26,190 --> 00:13:27,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie was sitting over there.</font>

336
00:13:27,470 --> 00:13:31,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She actually wanted some advice.</font>

337
00:13:31,110 --> 00:13:32,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wanted someone to talk it through with.</font>

338
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:33,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, she figured</font>

339
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:34,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dong</font>

340
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gets along with the guys, right?</font>

341
00:13:35,910 --> 00:13:37,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what she had in mind.</font>

342
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she couldn't pick anyone.</font>

343
00:13:41,990 --> 00:13:42,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to leave the island.</font>

344
00:13:43,150 --> 00:13:45,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want to be done with this.</font>

345
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:46,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this...</font>

346
00:13:46,190 --> 00:13:47,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Annie</font>

347
00:13:47,110 --> 00:13:47,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just wanted to talk to Dong.</font>

348
00:13:47,990 --> 00:13:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it's not about that.</font>

349
00:13:50,310 --> 00:13:52,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what he said to me?</font>

350
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:53,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dong.</font>

351
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:53,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did he say?</font>

352
00:13:55,470 --> 00:13:57,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait. Let me calm down first.</font>

353
00:13:58,310 --> 00:13:58,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did he say?</font>

354
00:13:59,110 --> 00:14:00,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So he did say something.</font>

355
00:14:04,070 --> 00:14:05,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said our habits</font>

356
00:14:05,990 --> 00:14:07,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the way we think</font>

357
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:09,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are at opposite ends of the spectrum.</font>

358
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:12,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't stay up late.</font>

359
00:14:12,230 --> 00:14:12,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, he said...</font>

360
00:14:12,950 --> 00:14:14,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He goes to bed early, and I stay up late.</font>

361
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:16,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't use his phone, and I do.</font>

362
00:14:16,590 --> 00:14:17,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

363
00:14:17,390 --> 00:14:18,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said we're different.</font>

364
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:20,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really different, apparently.</font>

365
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:21,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just froze.</font>

366
00:14:21,430 --> 00:14:23,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was like, what is this?</font>

367
00:14:23,590 --> 00:14:25,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's even happening?</font>

368
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:28,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said he had a lot of doubts.</font>

369
00:14:28,110 --> 00:14:29,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He worried that here on the island,</font>

370
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:31,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we could tune out everything else,</font>

371
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:32,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">talk, and have a good time.</font>

372
00:14:32,990 --> 00:14:35,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But once we left,</font>

373
00:14:35,350 --> 00:14:36,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyday life might get in the way.</font>

374
00:14:38,230 --> 00:14:40,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He sounded so serious</font>

375
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:42,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that it took me right back</font>

376
00:14:42,430 --> 00:14:44,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Like being dumped]
to how I felt when I got dumped.</font>

377
00:14:44,470 --> 00:14:45,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

378
00:14:45,030 --> 00:14:46,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like someone sitting you down</font>

379
00:14:46,070 --> 00:14:46,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a really serious conversation.</font>

380
00:14:46,910 --> 00:14:49,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I felt awful.</font>

381
00:14:49,750 --> 00:14:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just...</font>

382
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:52,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't explain it. He does have concerns.</font>

383
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:55,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he had to find a way</font>

384
00:14:55,070 --> 00:14:56,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bring them up.</font>

385
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get where he's coming from.</font>

386
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:02,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe he's just more mature.</font>

387
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:04,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that's a good thing.</font>

388
00:15:04,110 --> 00:15:05,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm glad he said it.</font>

389
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:05,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever happens,</font>

390
00:15:05,710 --> 00:15:07,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it was good to talk about it.</font>

391
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:08,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just got back</font>

392
00:15:08,430 --> 00:15:09,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm still a little shaken up.</font>

393
00:15:09,830 --> 00:15:11,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You both need to take a breath.</font>

394
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if he's calmed down yet.</font>

395
00:15:12,830 --> 00:15:13,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I left,</font>

396
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:14,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he still seemed pretty worked up.</font>

397
00:15:15,830 --> 00:15:17,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I'd stayed,</font>

398
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:20,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">neither of us had anything left to say.</font>

399
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:22,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I came back.</font>

400
00:15:22,430 --> 00:15:24,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now he and Annie</font>

401
00:15:24,110 --> 00:15:24,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are talking.</font>

402
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:32,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Runs into Cai Ziyi]
Why are you guys out here?</font>

403
00:15:32,710 --> 00:15:33,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're leaving.</font>

404
00:15:33,470 --> 00:15:34,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

405
00:15:34,230 --> 00:15:35,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you all went back to bed.</font>

406
00:15:35,230 --> 00:15:36,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you'd gone to bed.</font>

407
00:15:36,070 --> 00:15:37,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did everyone from your room</font>

408
00:15:37,430 --> 00:15:38,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go back to get some rest?</font>

409
00:15:38,790 --> 00:15:39,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

410
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:42,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't Xixi still in there?</font>

411
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Smiling]</font>

412
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:46,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

413
00:15:53,070 --> 00:15:54,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find Annie.</font>

414
00:15:54,110 --> 00:15:54,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie's on a date.</font>

415
00:15:54,990 --> 00:15:55,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you going to see her for?</font>

416
00:15:55,710 --> 00:15:57,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sneaking a peek]
I'm going to spy on a date.</font>

417
00:15:57,870 --> 00:15:59,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who'd Annie pick?</font>

418
00:15:59,990 --> 00:16:02,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know, but she's definitely on a date.</font>

419
00:16:02,430 --> 00:16:03,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to peek at Annie.</font>

420
00:16:03,470 --> 00:16:05,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did Annie pick? Where are they?</font>

421
00:16:05,430 --> 00:16:06,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't they announce it?</font>

422
00:16:06,910 --> 00:16:08,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No idea]</font>

423
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They only announced that she was going.</font>

424
00:16:09,990 --> 00:16:11,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

425
00:16:11,470 --> 00:16:13,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe she passed on the date.</font>

426
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:13,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't.</font>

427
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:14,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, she didn't.</font>

428
00:16:15,310 --> 00:16:15,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My guess</font>

429
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:16,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that she picked Dong.</font>

430
00:16:16,590 --> 00:16:17,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two finished their date,</font>

431
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:18,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then Dong went back over.</font>

432
00:16:19,230 --> 00:16:20,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

433
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two guys before were Wang Sheng and...</font>

434
00:16:21,830 --> 00:16:22,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six, seven...</font>

435
00:16:22,230 --> 00:16:22,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Figuring out Annie's date]
That leaves Dong.</font>

436
00:16:22,950 --> 00:16:23,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then it's Dong.</font>

437
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:24,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has to be Dong.</font>

438
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:27,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look,</font>

439
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:28,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er just left.</font>

440
00:16:29,630 --> 00:16:30,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe there are things</font>

441
00:16:30,190 --> 00:16:32,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you don't want to say in front of her.</font>

442
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:36,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know. It's just...</font>

443
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she's someone</font>

444
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:40,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who rarely takes the lead.</font>

445
00:16:40,870 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I usually know what I want.</font>

446
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:45,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if I can</font>

447
00:16:45,990 --> 00:16:48,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Different personalities]
help her come out of her shell.</font>

448
00:16:49,710 --> 00:16:50,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell you what.</font>

449
00:16:50,590 --> 00:16:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come talk to me after your date.</font>

450
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:54,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because, you know what?</font>

451
00:16:54,190 --> 00:16:55,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never get in my own head.</font>

452
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:56,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not?</font>

453
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:56,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I rarely overthink things.</font>

454
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:59,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think I...</font>

455
00:17:00,110 --> 00:17:00,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like, for example...</font>

456
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:01,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't care</font>

457
00:17:01,990 --> 00:17:02,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what people think of me.</font>

458
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:03,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you care?</font>

459
00:17:05,310 --> 00:17:05,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

460
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:06,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe part of it is...</font>

461
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:07,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if I should say this,</font>

462
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:09,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I think I might be</font>

463
00:17:09,070 --> 00:17:10,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a little self-centered.</font>

464
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:11,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In pretty much everything,</font>

465
00:17:11,670 --> 00:17:12,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I go by what I think</font>

466
00:17:12,950 --> 00:17:15,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and how I feel.</font>

467
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:18,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Other people's opinions don't really...</font>

468
00:17:18,190 --> 00:17:20,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How I feel is what matters most to me.</font>

469
00:17:20,030 --> 00:17:20,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always felt that way.</font>

470
00:17:20,990 --> 00:17:21,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm like that too.</font>

471
00:17:22,390 --> 00:17:24,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to feel comfortable with it.</font>

472
00:17:24,030 --> 00:17:24,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

473
00:17:25,950 --> 00:17:26,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might be too focused on myself.</font>

474
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to lose myself</font>

475
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:32,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or make compromises I don't want to make.</font>

476
00:17:32,470 --> 00:17:33,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't want anyone</font>

477
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:34,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doing that for me either.</font>

478
00:17:34,950 --> 00:17:35,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also someone</font>

479
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:37,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who hates bothering people.</font>

480
00:17:37,550 --> 00:17:38,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really hate asking for favors.</font>

481
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:42,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get ahead of myself,</font>

482
00:17:43,870 --> 00:17:44,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make assumptions,</font>

483
00:17:44,470 --> 00:17:47,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and imagine everything going wrong.</font>

484
00:17:47,910 --> 00:17:49,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's good to meet people.</font>

485
00:17:49,670 --> 00:17:50,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of us together.</font>

486
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:51,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just get to know each other.</font>

487
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:52,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hang out as a group.</font>

488
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:54,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But right now, it feels like</font>

489
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:56,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've put her in a really awkward spot.</font>

490
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's being so dramatic.</font>

491
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things were going too well for us.</font>

492
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's true.</font>

493
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Too intense]
It got too intense, you know?</font>

494
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't call it intense.</font>

495
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to vote with Moonstones every day.</font>

496
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're reading too much into the votes.</font>

497
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it possible</font>

498
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only really got to know you today?</font>

499
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

500
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I voted for you.</font>

501
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take me, for example.</font>

502
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still getting to know people]
I barely know anyone that well yet.</font>

503
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I give someone one more Moonstone,</font>

504
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">does that mean I actually love him?</font>

505
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it really mean</font>

506
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like him more than the other guy?</font>

507
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like I said,</font>

508
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in this setting,</font>

509
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">every little move</font>

510
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">looks like a huge signal.</font>

511
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

512
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But out in the real world,</font>

513
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what's the big deal if we grab dinner?</font>

514
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or get a coffee, right?</font>

515
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

516
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Life coach]
My life coach.</font>

517
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really like that about you, though.</font>

518
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just don't care.</font>

519
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I really don't.</font>

520
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

521
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's great.</font>

522
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? Isn't it a turnoff?</font>

523
00:18:59,040 --> 00:18:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

524
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

525
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's great.</font>

526
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, tell me about you.</font>

527
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you're afraid of things getting awkward.</font>

528
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And of conflict.</font>

529
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Afraid of conflict]</font>

530
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There hasn't really been any conflict, though.</font>

531
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you aren't afraid of conflict,</font>

532
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why did you have two cards that day</font>

533
