710
00:24:58,410 --> 00:25:00,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Funny, I thought the same thing.</font>

711
00:25:01,410 --> 00:25:02,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, he said so himself.</font>

712
00:25:02,450 --> 00:25:03,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He came out like this</font>

713
00:25:08,090 --> 00:25:09,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and walked like this.</font>

714
00:25:09,530 --> 00:25:09,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like that.</font>

715
00:25:09,930 --> 00:25:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he went all the way over there,</font>

716
00:25:13,170 --> 00:25:14,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he opened this door.</font>

717
00:25:14,690 --> 00:25:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was like, why is the leading lady still here?</font>

718
00:25:17,330 --> 00:25:18,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, when I walked in,</font>

719
00:25:18,410 --> 00:25:18,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw Annie</font>

720
00:25:18,890 --> 00:25:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still sitting on the right.</font>

721
00:25:19,850 --> 00:25:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I was like...</font>

722
00:25:21,290 --> 00:25:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, didn't I tell you?</font>

723
00:25:23,210 --> 00:25:24,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember how beautiful the sky was?</font>

724
00:25:24,890 --> 00:25:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I called them over for photos.</font>

725
00:25:26,490 --> 00:25:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the time it clicked,</font>

726
00:25:28,250 --> 00:25:29,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">almost an hour had passed.</font>

727
00:25:31,650 --> 00:25:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was like, why haven't we heard anything?</font>

728
00:25:37,170 --> 00:25:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hungry?</font>

729
00:25:38,090 --> 00:25:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hungry?]</font>

730
00:25:42,250 --> 00:25:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm okay.</font>

731
00:25:43,570 --> 00:25:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cook for you tonight.</font>

732
00:25:45,490 --> 00:25:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Egg fried rice.</font>

733
00:25:47,410 --> 00:25:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When?</font>

734
00:25:53,530 --> 00:25:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whenever you want it.</font>

735
00:25:55,730 --> 00:25:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anytime.</font>

736
00:25:59,090 --> 00:26:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make you 10 dishes.</font>

737
00:26:00,810 --> 00:26:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? We don't have the ingredients.</font>

738
00:26:02,610 --> 00:26:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, that's the problem.</font>

739
00:26:03,490 --> 00:26:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All I can make is egg fried rice.</font>

740
00:26:11,770 --> 00:26:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How tragic. My heart breaks for you.</font>

741
00:26:31,490 --> 00:26:32,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your phone has a fill light?</font>

742
00:26:32,850 --> 00:26:33,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

743
00:26:33,490 --> 00:26:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only this little foldable has one.</font>

744
00:26:34,530 --> 00:26:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so handy. Cool, right?</font>

745
00:26:36,010 --> 00:26:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

746
00:26:38,250 --> 00:26:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So pretty.</font>

747
00:26:44,770 --> 00:26:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attention, islanders.</font>

748
00:26:46,730 --> 00:26:50,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truth Night on the Island of Affection is about to begin.</font>

749
00:26:56,290 --> 00:26:57,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So pretty.</font>

750
00:26:58,690 --> 00:27:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you sitting?</font>

751
00:27:00,250 --> 00:27:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sit here on the end.</font>

752
00:27:06,690 --> 00:27:07,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sitting with Yuning.</font>

753
00:27:13,250 --> 00:27:14,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looks over]</font>

754
00:27:20,930 --> 00:27:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Turns and sits]</font>

755
00:27:26,650 --> 00:27:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is anyone sitting here?</font>

756
00:27:27,370 --> 00:27:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. Go ahead.</font>

757
00:27:37,730 --> 00:27:39,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's this card?</font>

758
00:27:41,090 --> 00:27:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We write down our truths, right?</font>

759
00:27:43,050 --> 00:27:44,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have any truths to share.</font>

760
00:27:45,090 --> 00:27:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looks over, then away]</font>

761
00:28:05,610 --> 00:28:07,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sizing up the room]</font>

762
00:28:07,530 --> 00:28:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Gao?</font>

763
00:28:09,130 --> 00:28:10,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[One seat left]</font>

764
00:28:11,450 --> 00:28:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can sit over there, actually.</font>

765
00:28:16,820 --> 00:28:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'll sit here.</font>

766
00:28:21,620 --> 00:28:22,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next to Yang,</font>

767
00:28:22,540 --> 00:28:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there was another seat.</font>

768
00:28:23,140 --> 00:28:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I told him</font>

769
00:28:23,980 --> 00:28:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there was a seat over there</font>

770
00:28:24,780 --> 00:28:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if he wanted it.</font>

771
00:28:25,820 --> 00:28:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he sat there anyway.</font>

772
00:28:27,940 --> 00:28:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I was avoiding him a little.</font>

773
00:28:29,420 --> 00:28:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The whole time, I didn't want</font>

774
00:28:31,060 --> 00:28:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to look over at him.</font>

775
00:28:39,140 --> 00:28:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your smooth operator is here.</font>

776
00:28:43,460 --> 00:28:44,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mine?</font>

777
00:28:44,540 --> 00:28:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Last islander arrives]
I'm here.</font>

778
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to try some?</font>

779
00:28:51,980 --> 00:28:52,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's this?</font>

780
00:28:52,780 --> 00:28:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a palmier.</font>

781
00:28:53,460 --> 00:28:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just pick whatever looks good.</font>

782
00:28:59,460 --> 00:28:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coconut water.</font>

783
00:29:00,780 --> 00:29:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

784
00:29:01,140 --> 00:29:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

785
00:29:02,820 --> 00:29:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you tried it?</font>

786
00:29:04,540 --> 00:29:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coconut water?</font>

787
00:29:05,300 --> 00:29:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looks down]
There's coconut water here.</font>

788
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's coconut water.</font>

789
00:29:07,940 --> 00:29:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

790
00:29:09,860 --> 00:29:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

791
00:29:16,780 --> 00:29:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers.</font>

792
00:29:20,380 --> 00:29:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truth Night.</font>

793
00:29:21,820 --> 00:29:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take turns drawing a truth slip.</font>

794
00:29:24,820 --> 00:29:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do the action first.</font>

795
00:29:27,580 --> 00:29:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then reveal the question on the slip.</font>

796
00:29:29,580 --> 00:29:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember, you can't read</font>

797
00:29:31,740 --> 00:29:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the action out loud.</font>

798
00:29:32,820 --> 00:29:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

799
00:29:34,860 --> 00:29:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

800
00:29:42,260 --> 00:29:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, easy.</font>

801
00:29:43,620 --> 00:29:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pick a kind of weather</font>

802
00:29:44,860 --> 00:29:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that describes how you feel...</font>

803
00:29:47,220 --> 00:29:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your love life, actually. And say why.</font>

804
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's easy.</font>

805
00:29:51,820 --> 00:29:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Way too easy.</font>

806
00:29:53,260 --> 00:29:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't I get to guess this one?</font>

807
00:29:55,540 --> 00:29:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd say</font>

808
00:29:58,660 --> 00:30:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cloudy, with the sun about to come out.</font>

809
00:30:01,100 --> 00:30:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Q: What weather fits your love life?
Cloudy, with the sun about to come out]</font>

810
00:30:07,220 --> 00:30:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know how I feel about some of it.</font>

811
00:30:09,580 --> 00:30:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Most of it, actually.</font>

812
00:30:13,620 --> 00:30:14,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's poetic.</font>

813
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang,</font>

814
00:30:14,700 --> 00:30:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take notes, will you?</font>

815
00:30:15,780 --> 00:30:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't just say "wow" all day.</font>

816
00:30:18,860 --> 00:30:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

817
00:30:19,580 --> 00:30:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to become a man of culture.</font>

818
00:30:30,940 --> 00:30:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm charging people to say it from now on.</font>

819
00:30:32,540 --> 00:30:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my catchphrase.</font>

820
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tip: Do the dare before revealing it]</font>

821
00:30:46,780 --> 00:30:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Walks straight past]</font>

822
00:30:56,460 --> 00:30:57,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me your hand.</font>

823
00:30:59,340 --> 00:31:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me your hand for a second.</font>

824
00:31:02,460 --> 00:31:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fingers interlaced]</font>

825
00:31:03,740 --> 00:31:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do this.</font>

826
00:31:05,780 --> 00:31:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like this.</font>

827
00:31:21,460 --> 00:31:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You lace your fingers together.</font>

828
00:31:29,740 --> 00:31:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like that.</font>

829
00:31:31,140 --> 00:31:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the action.</font>

830
00:31:33,220 --> 00:31:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now guess the question.</font>

831
00:31:39,780 --> 00:31:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guy in denim.</font>

832
00:31:41,980 --> 00:31:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The denim jacket.</font>

833
00:31:43,900 --> 00:31:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

834
00:31:44,980 --> 00:31:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, this can't be something ordinary.</font>

835
00:31:47,380 --> 00:31:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is worth a wow.</font>

836
00:31:48,340 --> 00:31:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's definitely something big.</font>

837
00:31:52,500 --> 00:31:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The person here you get along with best is...</font>

838
00:31:54,220 --> 00:31:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lace your fingers together.</font>

839
00:31:55,220 --> 00:31:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

840
00:31:57,660 --> 00:32:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guy you're least likely</font>

841
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to end up dating.</font>

842
00:32:03,340 --> 00:32:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lace your fingers together.</font>

843
00:32:03,940 --> 00:32:05,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then me?</font>

844
00:32:05,020 --> 00:32:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

845
00:32:05,900 --> 00:32:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My class rep is such a good guy.</font>

846
00:32:06,940 --> 00:32:08,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could that be it, right?</font>

847
00:32:18,620 --> 00:32:19,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll read it out.</font>

848
00:32:20,620 --> 00:32:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think anyone's going to get it.</font>

849
00:32:21,820 --> 00:32:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Q: Who did you like but never pursue?]
This one's hard to guess.</font>

850
00:32:23,260 --> 00:32:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lace your fingers with theirs]
Of all the other islanders,</font>

851
00:32:24,140 --> 00:32:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who did you like but never pursue?</font>

852
00:32:31,700 --> 00:32:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly, there isn't anyone.</font>

853
00:32:35,060 --> 00:32:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure you can all tell.</font>

854
00:32:36,940 --> 00:32:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I like someone, I go for it.</font>

855
00:32:39,460 --> 00:32:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here comes Ms. Smooth.</font>

856
00:32:40,980 --> 00:32:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smooth!</font>

857
00:32:44,220 --> 00:32:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this truth or dare?</font>

858
00:32:46,100 --> 00:32:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both.</font>

859
00:32:51,740 --> 00:32:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Trying not to laugh]</font>

860
00:33:00,380 --> 00:33:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Keep that swagger away from me]</font>

861
00:33:02,740 --> 00:33:04,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Swagger is your whole life.</font>

862
00:33:04,140 --> 00:33:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it up.</font>

863
00:33:05,220 --> 00:33:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Swagger is your whole life.</font>

864
00:33:06,580 --> 00:33:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it up.</font>

865
00:33:15,700 --> 00:33:16,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, hers is...</font>

866
00:33:18,420 --> 00:33:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Swagger is my whole life.</font>

867
00:33:19,300 --> 00:33:21,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I keep that up,</font>

868
00:33:21,470 --> 00:33:23,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this one's a little more heartfelt.</font>

869
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:25,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the heartfelt one?</font>

870
00:33:26,390 --> 00:33:26,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

871
00:33:28,230 --> 00:33:29,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, get me a ride home.</font>

872
00:33:29,750 --> 00:33:31,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it's a little sad.</font>

873
00:33:31,190 --> 00:33:33,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a moment that's kind of sad,</font>

874
00:33:33,430 --> 00:33:35,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you want to give him some comfort,</font>

875
00:33:35,630 --> 00:33:37,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some support.</font>

876
00:33:37,110 --> 00:33:38,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I think I get it.</font>

877
00:33:38,310 --> 00:33:40,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He likes you, but you want</font>

878
00:33:40,910 --> 00:33:42,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to turn him down.</font>

879
00:33:42,190 --> 00:33:43,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something like that?</font>

880
00:33:43,190 --> 00:33:43,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty close.</font>

881
00:33:43,630 --> 00:33:45,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you were about to leave the island,</font>

882
00:33:45,310 --> 00:33:47,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which islander of the opposite sex</font>

883
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:48,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you most want to say goodbye to?</font>

884
00:33:48,470 --> 00:33:50,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Walk up to them</font>

885
00:33:50,590 --> 00:33:52,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and tell them what you most want to say.</font>

886
00:33:52,350 --> 00:33:53,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a good one.</font>

887
00:33:53,950 --> 00:33:55,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

888
00:33:55,270 --> 00:33:56,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that's a reward for you.</font>

889
