<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Another reward for me?</font>

890
00:33:57,910 --> 00:33:59,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything's a reward for me, bro.</font>

891
00:33:59,270 --> 00:34:00,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You call everything a reward.</font>

892
00:34:03,550 --> 00:34:05,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The first time you felt a spark</font>

893
