896
00:34:09,830 --> 00:34:12,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the smoothest of them all, seriously.</font>

897
00:34:12,270 --> 00:34:13,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our smooth operator, for real.</font>

898
00:34:15,990 --> 00:34:16,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Q: When did you first feel a spark?]</font>

899
00:34:16,150 --> 00:34:17,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Go tell them in person]
Go ahead.</font>

900
00:34:17,790 --> 00:34:18,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

901
