906
00:34:42,830 --> 00:34:43,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't keep a straight face]</font>

907
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:46,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch that face, babe.</font>

908
00:35:06,310 --> 00:35:07,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Bursts out laughing]</font>

909
00:35:15,030 --> 00:35:17,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was when we made pasta together.</font>

910
00:35:17,590 --> 00:35:18,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

911
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:20,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sneaks away]
I'm done.</font>

912
00:35:23,350 --> 00:35:24,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Making pasta.</font>

913
00:35:28,230 --> 00:35:30,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you feel a spark?</font>

914
00:35:30,990 --> 00:35:31,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The biggest spark?</font>

915
00:35:31,870 --> 00:35:33,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, the moment you felt it.</font>

916
00:35:33,750 --> 00:35:34,790
