918
00:35:36,670 --> 00:35:39,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't call it falling for someone.</font>

919
00:35:39,510 --> 00:35:39,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just...</font>

920
00:35:39,950 --> 00:35:41,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what you mean.</font>

921
00:35:41,470 --> 00:35:42,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

922
00:35:42,270 --> 00:35:43,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The question was,</font>

923
00:35:43,230 --> 00:35:45,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since you arrived, when did you first</font>

924
00:35:45,430 --> 00:35:48,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">feel drawn to another islander?</font>

925
00:35:50,110 --> 00:35:52,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think back on your time on the Island of Affection.</font>

926
00:35:52,510 --> 00:35:54,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you feel jealous?</font>

927
00:36:00,670 --> 00:36:02,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is wild, bro. Absolutely wild.</font>

928
00:36:02,390 --> 00:36:04,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a draw.</font>

929
00:36:13,870 --> 00:36:15,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you feel jealous?</font>

930
00:36:21,910 --> 00:36:23,790
