933
00:36:28,030 --> 00:36:29,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I didn't get picked, I guess.</font>

934
00:36:29,630 --> 00:36:30,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Next question. Moving on.</font>

935
00:36:34,510 --> 00:36:35,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So honest.</font>

936
00:36:37,830 --> 00:36:39,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't it earlier than that?</font>

937
00:36:39,790 --> 00:36:41,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, shouldn't it have been earlier?</font>

938
00:36:44,350 --> 00:36:45,550
