We each get half a seat.</font>

939
00:36:45,550 --> 00:36:46,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that a little too flirty?</font>

940
00:36:58,870 --> 00:36:59,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was fine back then.</font>

941
00:36:59,910 --> 00:37:00,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, right.</font>

942
00:37:08,150 --> 00:37:10,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't keep a straight face]</font>

943
00:37:10,310 --> 00:37:13,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously? You're playing it like that?</font>

944
00:37:15,230 --> 00:37:17,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sneaking a look]</font>

945
00:37:19,310 --> 00:37:21,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does everyone who draws this</font>

946
