947
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:24,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

948
00:37:31,230 --> 00:37:34,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's closest to your ideal type here?</font>

949
00:37:34,110 --> 00:37:36,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say their name and why.</font>

950
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:47,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's fun.</font>

951
00:37:47,990 --> 00:37:49,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fun.</font>

952
00:37:49,550 --> 00:37:51,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a little awkward with so many people.</font>

953
00:37:59,470 --> 00:38:02,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing worse than a sudden silence.</font>

954
00:38:07,070 --> 00:38:08,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, I like</font>

955
00:38:12,110 --> 00:38:13,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing's looks.</font>

956
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And...</font>

957
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feng's special skill.</font>

958
00:38:41,040 --> 00:38:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feng's special skill?</font>

959
