<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What skill?</font>

960
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Making coffee.</font>

961
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And...</font>

962
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang's...</font>

963
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sense of humor.</font>

964
00:39:08,600 --> 00:39:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I described my ideal type,</font>

965
00:39:10,120 --> 00:39:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said I wanted a youthful guy who'd look after me.</font>

966
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a sharp question.</font>

967
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little too sharp.</font>

968
00:39:22,480 --> 00:39:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These questions really go for it.</font>

969
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang was sitting right next to me.</font>

970
00:39:28,240 --> 00:39:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt so much pressure.</font>

971
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know how to answer.</font>

972
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe I still</font>

973
00:39:31,600 --> 00:39:33,000
