974
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a clear idea of my ideal type.</font>

975
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I pieced one together.</font>

976
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pass those snacks over.</font>

977
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we bring this box over?</font>

978
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:47,800
