979
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's pretty good.</font>

980
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to ask...</font>

981
00:39:57,120 --> 00:39:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tobe,</font>

982
00:40:00,040 --> 00:40:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you give me any Moonstones last night?</font>

983
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Did you vote for me last night?]</font>

984
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoa.</font>

985
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you ask that?</font>

986
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

987
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No?</font>

988
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't.</font>

989
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then who'd you vote for?</font>

990
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me explain the question.</font>

991
00:40:48,160 --> 00:40:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It says to pick an islander of the opposite sex</font>

992
00:40:50,160 --> 00:40:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ask something you've always wanted to ask</font>

993
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but never said out loud.</font>

994
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because today,</font>

995
00:40:54,480 --> 00:40:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we were talking,</font>

996
00:40:56,040 --> 00:40:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he told me</font>

997
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'd voted for me.</font>

998
00:40:58,840 --> 00:40:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, what I said was...</font>

999
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome to Werewolf.</font>

1000
00:41:15,680 --> 00:41:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I said was...</font>

1001
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So did you vote for me?</font>

1002
00:41:22,280 --> 00:41:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did.</font>

1003
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many?</font>

1004
00:41:23,720 --> 00:41:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

1005
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we allowed to ask? I don't know.</font>

1006
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't vote for you.</font>

1007
00:41:27,720 --> 00:41:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might not have voted for you.</font>

1008
00:41:30,080 --> 00:41:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

1009
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't remember if I voted for you.</font>

1010
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know either. I didn't hear it.</font>

1011
00:41:35,720 --> 00:41:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can explain for him.</font>

1012
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm his roommate. We're close.</font>

1013
00:41:38,040 --> 00:41:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We talked for ages.</font>

1014
00:41:39,040 --> 00:41:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't really notice you on day 1,</font>

1015
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he told me today</font>

1016
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's interested in you.</font>

1017
00:41:42,560 --> 00:41:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's true. He wasn't lying to you.</font>

1018
00:41:46,640 --> 00:41:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really do want</font>

1019
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep getting to know her.</font>

1020
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope she won't hold it against me</font>

1021
00:41:50,440 --> 00:41:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I misspoke in the moment.</font>

1022
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you asked about the About Bread profile,</font>

1023
00:41:56,520 --> 00:41:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you meant whether I'd read yours.</font>

1024
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I thought you were asking</font>

1025
00:41:59,440 --> 00:42:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I'd vote for you today.</font>

1026
00:42:03,560 --> 00:42:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things just got interesting.</font>

1027
00:42:07,520 --> 00:42:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's a truth.</font>

1028
00:42:08,840 --> 00:42:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you had to pick a song</font>

1029
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the person you're drawn to,</font>

1030
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which song would it be and why?</font>

1031
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd pick "Sunny Day."</font>

1032
00:42:15,040 --> 00:42:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing her puts me in a better mood.</font>

1033
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it doesn't say I have to name her.</font>

1034
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So who is it?</font>

1035
00:42:21,680 --> 00:42:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have follow-up questions.</font>

1036
00:42:22,600 --> 00:42:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're allowed to ask.</font>

1037
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one.</font>

1038
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's her name?</font>

1039
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuyue.</font>

1040
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you draw one for me?</font>

1041
00:42:42,600 --> 00:42:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here you go.</font>

1042
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it a new question?</font>

1043
00:42:45,040 --> 00:42:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, brand-new.</font>

1044
00:42:53,600 --> 00:42:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good luck.</font>

1045
00:42:54,640 --> 00:42:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need a deep breath too?</font>

1046
00:43:00,760 --> 00:43:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on over here?</font>

1047
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Making good TV, huh?</font>

1048
00:44:15,610 --> 00:44:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pulls away]</font>

1049
00:44:20,450 --> 00:44:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

1050
00:44:24,490 --> 00:44:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I get up?</font>

1051
00:44:26,530 --> 00:44:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do I do?</font>

1052
00:44:27,010 --> 00:44:27,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give her a little pull.</font>

1053
00:44:27,650 --> 00:44:28,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm supposed to pull?</font>

1054
00:44:28,410 --> 00:44:28,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to.</font>

1055
00:44:28,970 --> 00:44:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

1056
00:44:29,490 --> 00:44:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

1057
00:44:30,050 --> 00:44:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to.</font>

1058
00:44:31,690 --> 00:44:34,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I don't want to]</font>

1059
00:44:41,930 --> 00:44:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The instruction says</font>

1060
00:44:42,770 --> 00:44:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to give her a gentle pull, okay?</font>

1061
00:44:45,130 --> 00:44:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tug gently.</font>

1062
00:44:46,170 --> 00:44:46,570
