<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take it.</font>

1238
00:53:38,860 --> 00:53:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sits next to her]
Wow, you really kept your promise.</font>

1239
00:53:50,420 --> 00:53:53,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng to Ren Chunxi: 4 Moonstones]
I gave Ren Chunxi 4 today.</font>

1240
00:53:53,270 --> 00:53:55,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though I've felt something for her,</font>

1241
00:53:55,750 --> 00:53:57,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never been the one to make a move.</font>

1242
00:53:57,710 --> 00:54:00,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today I wanted to take the initiative</font>

1243
00:54:00,470 --> 00:54:01,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let her get to know me better.</font>

1244
00:54:04,110 --> 00:54:06,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng to Cai Ziyi: 1 Moonstone]
And I gave Cai Ziyi 1.</font>

1245
00:54:06,790 --> 00:54:07,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cai Ziyi is</font>

1246
00:54:07,670 --> 00:54:08,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a really kind person.</font>

1247
00:54:08,670 --> 00:54:09,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's a good person.</font>

1248
00:54:09,550 --> 00:54:10,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During the challenge this afternoon,</font>

1249
00:54:10,630 --> 00:54:11,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nobody really noticed</font>

1250
00:54:11,710 --> 00:54:13,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I'd hurt my leg.</font>

1251
00:54:13,390 --> 00:54:16,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As soon as it ended, she went to get antiseptic.</font>

1252
00:54:16,110 --> 00:54:17,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really touched.</font>

1253
00:54:17,630 --> 00:54:19,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I gave her 1 today.</font>

1254
00:54:19,990 --> 00:54:21,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still hope she stays on the island.</font>

1255
00:54:24,190 --> 00:54:26,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey.</font>

1256
00:54:28,030 --> 00:54:29,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you back?</font>

1257
00:54:29,910 --> 00:54:30,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come you're back?</font>

1258
00:54:31,790 --> 00:54:32,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd you come back?</font>

1259
00:54:32,470 --> 00:54:33,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1260
00:54:33,950 --> 00:54:34,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you need? I'll get someone for you.</font>

1261
00:54:36,190 --> 00:54:38,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't hear a word you said.</font>

1262
00:54:38,230 --> 00:54:39,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said, what do you need? I'll get someone.</font>

1263
00:54:41,390 --> 00:54:42,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

1264
00:54:45,630 --> 00:54:47,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so tired.</font>

1265
00:54:47,470 --> 00:54:49,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you go back and get some sleep?</font>

1266
00:54:49,390 --> 00:54:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't sleep.</font>

1267
00:54:50,310 --> 00:54:51,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I sleep now,</font>

1268
00:54:51,590 --> 00:54:53,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't sleep tonight.</font>

1269
00:54:53,550 --> 00:54:53,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

1270
00:55:14,590 --> 00:55:15,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today I honestly</font>

1271
00:55:15,230 --> 00:55:17,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't feel drawn to anyone.</font>

1272
00:55:17,110 --> 00:55:20,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I voted for guys I respect.</font>

1273
00:55:22,030 --> 00:55:28,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cai Ziyi: Gao Yuheng 2, Huang Siyang 1, Liang Yongfeng 2 Moonstones]</font>

1274
00:55:29,590 --> 00:55:30,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't vote for him.</font>

1275
00:55:32,150 --> 00:55:33,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I feel like</font>

1276
00:55:34,790 --> 00:55:37,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already given enough.</font>

1277
00:55:37,550 --> 00:55:39,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The response I got</font>

1278
00:55:40,950 --> 00:55:42,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made me pull back.</font>

1279
00:55:42,910 --> 00:55:45,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a good person.</font>

1280
00:55:46,910 --> 00:55:49,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just don't see a reason to keep giving.</font>

1281
00:55:58,230 --> 00:55:59,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liang Yongfeng to Cai Ziyi: 2 Moonstones]</font>

1282
00:55:59,830 --> 00:56:01,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't expect Ziyi</font>

1283
00:56:01,270 --> 00:56:02,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or Zhang Yi to say</font>

1284
00:56:02,990 --> 00:56:05,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were interested in me</font>

1285
00:56:05,030 --> 00:56:06,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wanted to see where it might go.</font>

1286
00:56:07,350 --> 00:56:10,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liang Yongfeng to Zhang Yi: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1287
00:56:12,870 --> 00:56:13,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feng</font>

1288
00:56:13,790 --> 00:56:14,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seems like a good guy.</font>

1289
00:56:14,710 --> 00:56:15,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to get to know him better.</font>

1290
00:56:15,990 --> 00:56:17,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His survival points</font>

1291
00:56:17,110 --> 00:56:18,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are on the low side for the guys.</font>

1292
00:56:19,270 --> 00:56:19,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhang Yi to Liang Yongfeng: 3 Moonstones]</font>

1293
00:56:19,630 --> 00:56:21,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I gave him a little more.</font>

1294
00:56:21,990 --> 00:56:22,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for Gao,</font>

1295
00:56:22,350 --> 00:56:23,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always vote for him.</font>

1296
00:56:23,470 --> 00:56:24,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhang Yi to Gao Yuheng: 1 Moonstone]
I've been voting for him all along.</font>

1297
00:56:29,630 --> 00:56:30,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt a little bad today.</font>

1298
00:56:30,910 --> 00:56:32,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After I called you a smooth operator,</font>

1299
00:56:32,470 --> 00:56:33,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I worried people would think</font>

1300
00:56:33,950 --> 00:56:35,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were just a joke.</font>

1301
00:56:35,390 --> 00:56:36,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

1302
00:56:36,190 --> 00:56:37,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You already ruined my chances.</font>

1303
00:56:39,270 --> 00:56:40,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

1304
00:56:41,230 --> 00:56:42,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm kidding.</font>

1305
00:56:42,670 --> 00:56:44,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I'm voting for you, you know?</font>

1306
00:56:44,630 --> 00:56:45,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1307
00:56:48,750 --> 00:56:49,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Gao.</font>

1308
00:56:49,510 --> 00:56:50,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really do feel bad.</font>

1309
00:56:50,590 --> 00:56:52,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you an extra one, okay?</font>

1310
00:56:52,350 --> 00:56:54,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No hard feelings]
I do feel like I owe you one.</font>

1311
00:56:54,830 --> 00:56:56,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll still call you a smooth operator, though.</font>

1312
00:56:56,630 --> 00:56:58,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You took it in stride,</font>

1313
00:56:58,070 --> 00:56:59,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that made me really happy.</font>

1314
00:56:59,510 --> 00:57:00,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qian Shihan to Gao Yuheng: 2]
Okay.</font>

1315
00:57:02,270 --> 00:57:02,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qian Shihan: Wang Tianqing 1, Zheng Shoudong 1, Liang Yongfeng 1]</font>

1316
00:57:02,550 --> 00:57:03,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's settled.</font>

1317
00:57:03,230 --> 00:57:04,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone deserves a chance to stay.</font>

1318
00:57:07,270 --> 00:57:08,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell you what.</font>

1319
00:57:08,350 --> 00:57:09,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to do one thing for me.</font>

1320
00:57:09,670 --> 00:57:11,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean? I don't get it.</font>

1321
00:57:11,150 --> 00:57:11,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go look for yourself.</font>

1322
00:57:11,910 --> 00:57:13,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Invites her to view his profile]
My Love & Bread profile.</font>

1323
00:57:16,830 --> 00:57:18,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want me to look at yours?</font>

1324
00:57:18,990 --> 00:57:21,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, but I'm not spending survival points.</font>

1325
00:57:21,070 --> 00:57:21,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You spend your own.</font>

1326
00:57:23,670 --> 00:57:25,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only 2 points.</font>

1327
00:57:25,790 --> 00:57:26,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're already in first place.</font>

1328
00:57:26,710 --> 00:57:28,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I didn't mind either way.</font>

1329
00:57:28,430 --> 00:57:30,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why not look at mine?]
It costs the same to see anyone's.</font>

1330
00:57:30,950 --> 00:57:31,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So why not look at mine?</font>

1331
00:57:37,590 --> 00:57:38,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want her to get to know me better.</font>

1332
00:57:38,910 --> 00:57:40,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she starts to like me,</font>

1333
00:57:40,510 --> 00:57:42,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know I'll fall for her even more.</font>

1334
00:57:47,590 --> 00:57:48,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao Yuheng to Qian Shihan: 5 Moonstones]</font>

1335
00:57:48,750 --> 00:57:49,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I gave Qian Shihan all of mine.</font>

1336
00:58:00,350 --> 00:58:02,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day before yesterday, I gave Tobe Lei</font>

1337
00:58:02,030 --> 00:58:03,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">1 Moonstone.</font>

1338
00:58:03,230 --> 00:58:04,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After spending more time together,</font>

1339
00:58:04,510 --> 00:58:07,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chen Shuyue to Tobe Lei: 2 Moonstones]
I wanted to know him better.</font>

1340
00:58:07,270 --> 00:58:09,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I gave him one more.</font>

1341
00:58:09,070 --> 00:58:10,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it was wild.</font>

1342
00:58:10,030 --> 00:58:11,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's good. People know what they want.</font>

1343
00:58:11,870 --> 00:58:13,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she asked him that question,</font>

1344
00:58:13,510 --> 00:58:14,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought she was really brave.</font>

1345
00:58:14,870 --> 00:58:16,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Did you vote for me last night?"</font>

1346
00:58:16,630 --> 00:58:17,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She put me right on the spot.</font>

1347
00:58:17,790 --> 00:58:20,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were thrilled inside, bro.</font>

1348
00:58:20,030 --> 00:58:21,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over the moon.</font>

1349
00:58:21,310 --> 00:58:22,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I was.</font>

1350
00:58:25,150 --> 00:58:26,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei to Chen Shuyue: 3 Moonstones]</font>

1351
00:58:26,470 --> 00:58:27,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave Chen Shuyue 3</font>

1352
00:58:27,910 --> 00:58:29,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we talked today</font>

1353
00:58:29,950 --> 00:58:31,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I felt really good about it.</font>

1354
00:58:31,510 --> 00:58:33,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So when you looked at the profiles this morning,</font>

1355
00:58:33,750 --> 00:58:35,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were you hoping to see mine?</font>

1356
00:58:35,150 --> 00:58:36,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I wanted to.</font>

1357
00:58:36,590 --> 00:58:37,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I wanted to see your About Bread profile.</font>

1358
00:58:39,230 --> 00:58:39,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

1359
00:58:42,390 --> 00:58:43,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We both arrived together.</font>

1360
00:58:43,350 --> 00:58:44,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I wanted to get to know you.</font>

1361
00:58:44,630 --> 00:58:46,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I get to know you,</font>

1362
00:58:46,390 --> 00:58:47,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're starting from the same place.</font>

1363
00:58:47,550 --> 00:58:49,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With anyone else, I feel a little</font>

1364
00:58:49,030 --> 00:58:50,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">weird about it, you know?</font>

1365
00:58:50,550 --> 00:58:51,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like it's wrong?</font>

1366
00:58:51,190 --> 00:58:52,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like I'm getting in the middle of something.</font>

1367
00:58:53,950 --> 00:58:55,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were supposed to be the bombshells,</font>

1368
00:58:55,270 --> 00:58:56,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shaking up everyone's relationships.</font>

1369
00:58:56,590 --> 00:58:57,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1370
00:58:57,750 --> 00:58:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we didn't shake anything up.</font>

1371
00:58:58,720 --> 00:59:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just ended up together.</font>

1372
00:59:01,200 --> 00:59:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also curious</font>

1373
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what she's really like.</font>

1374
00:59:05,280 --> 00:59:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope I get a chance</font>

1375
00:59:06,400 --> 00:59:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to spend more time with her.</font>

1376
00:59:10,400 --> 00:59:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you give her all 5?</font>

1377
00:59:11,520 --> 00:59:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1378
00:59:12,480 --> 00:59:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I still gave Jin Zhenyu</font>

1379
00:59:14,160 --> 00:59:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">1 pity vote.</font>

1380
00:59:18,120 --> 00:59:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Xinran to Jin Zhenyu: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1381
00:59:18,920 --> 00:59:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I figured no one would pick him.</font>

1382
00:59:22,440 --> 00:59:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me feeling sorry for other people.</font>

1383
00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might be the one who gets sent home.</font>

1384
00:59:29,280 --> 00:59:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since day 1,</font>

1385
00:59:29,960 --> 00:59:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've voted the same way.</font>

1386
00:59:31,920 --> 00:59:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing's changed.</font>

1387
00:59:32,600 --> 00:59:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been consistent.</font>

1388
00:59:36,600 --> 00:59:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How I feel about her,</font>

1389
00:59:38,880 --> 00:59:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from day 1 through day 4,</font>

1390
00:59:41,480 --> 00:59:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hasn't really changed much.</font>

1391
00:59:43,080 --> 00:59:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's stayed about the same,</font>

1392
00:59:45,000 --> 00:59:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at that same level.</font>

1393
00:59:47,120 --> 00:59:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jin Zhenyu to Liu Xinran: 5 Moonstones]</font>

1394
00:59:51,760 --> 00:59:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't decide. It's driving me nuts.</font>

1395
00:59:55,000 --> 00:59:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you give him all of yours?</font>

1396
00:59:56,640 --> 00:59:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After what he said to me,</font>

1397
00:59:57,960 --> 01:00:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I give him all of mine?</font>

1398
01:00:00,400 --> 01:00:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It reminded me of</font>

1399
01:00:02,000 --> 01:00:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an ex breaking up with me</font>

1400
01:00:03,560 --> 01:00:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and saying, "You're great and all.</font>

1401
01:00:05,400 --> 01:00:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just not right for each other."</font>

1402
01:00:06,720 --> 01:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if he's being honest</font>

1403
01:00:09,000 --> 01:00:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or using all of that as an excuse</font>

1404
01:00:12,200 --> 01:00:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to soften the blow.</font>

1405
01:00:16,600 --> 01:00:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It makes me feel awful.</font>

1406
01:00:23,200 --> 01:00:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really getting to me.</font>

1407
01:00:44,920 --> 01:00:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so torn.</font>

1408
01:00:53,880 --> 01:00:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My head was a mess.</font>

1409
01:00:55,480 --> 01:00:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I went blank,</font>

1410
01:00:56,400 --> 01:00:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because I didn't want to think about it.</font>

1411
01:01:26,760 --> 01:01:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hu Ke'er to Zheng Shoudong: 3]
I gave him 3 Moonstones.</font>

1412
01:01:28,720 --> 01:01:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What he said</font>

1413
01:01:30,600 --> 01:01:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might have affected me,</font>

1414
01:01:32,280 --> 01:01:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I still wanted</font>

1415
01:01:33,080 --> 01:01:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to give him most of mine.</font>

1416
01:01:36,440 --> 01:01:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The vote really did my head in.</font>

1417
01:01:42,080 --> 01:01:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather he didn't give me all of his tonight.</font>

1418
01:01:45,560 --> 01:01:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever.</font>

1419
01:01:52,320 --> 01:01:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you just really tired?</font>

1420
01:01:54,000 --> 01:01:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little.</font>

1421
01:01:55,560 --> 01:01:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot happened today.</font>

1422
01:01:59,600 --> 01:02:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how to deal with it anymore.</font>

1423
01:02:01,800 --> 01:02:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like I'm under so much pressure.</font>

1424
01:02:07,520 --> 01:02:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't change your Moonstone vote, did you?</font>

1425
01:02:09,640 --> 01:02:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the same as before, right?</font>

1426
01:02:10,480 --> 01:02:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I changed it.</font>

1427
01:02:13,240 --> 01:02:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait and see.</font>

1428
01:02:13,800 --> 01:02:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That big a change?</font>

1429
01:02:14,600 --> 01:02:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait and see.</font>

1430
01:02:15,600 --> 01:02:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm spending 2 survival points</font>

1431
01:02:17,400 --> 01:02:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take a look.</font>

1432
01:02:17,800 --> 01:02:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you'd been giving her all of yours, bro.</font>

1433
01:02:19,320 --> 01:02:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did before.</font>

1434
01:02:20,320 --> 01:02:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But today I had to change it.</font>

1435
01:02:22,200 --> 01:02:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get what you mean.</font>

1436
01:02:23,080 --> 01:02:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do get it.</font>

1437
01:02:34,280 --> 01:02:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Shoudong to Hu Ke'er: 2 Moonstones]</font>

1438
01:02:37,400 --> 01:02:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er...</font>

1439
01:02:37,800 --> 01:02:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I'm still giving her Moonstones.</font>

1440
01:02:39,320 --> 01:02:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out of everyone here,</font>

1441
01:02:40,080 --> 01:02:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er is still the only one</font>

1442
01:02:41,280 --> 01:02:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm interested in.</font>

1443
01:02:44,040 --> 01:02:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so stressed.</font>

1444
01:03:01,960 --> 01:03:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, diary time.</font>

1445
01:03:04,760 --> 01:03:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi.</font>

1446
01:03:06,760 --> 01:03:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

1447
01:03:10,080 --> 01:03:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk.</font>

1448
01:03:11,080 --> 01:03:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming.</font>

1449
01:03:14,320 --> 01:03:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, are you ready to jump in the river today?</font>

1450
01:03:16,320 --> 01:03:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Into the sea, more like.</font>

1451
01:03:17,200 --> 01:03:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done in.</font>

1452
01:03:18,320 --> 01:03:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why? You weren't this wiped out earlier.</font>

1453
01:03:20,480 --> 01:03:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am now.</font>

1454
01:03:20,840 --> 01:03:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All evening,</font>

1455
01:03:21,280 --> 01:03:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't felt like playing any games.</font>

1456
01:03:23,240 --> 01:03:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really haven't been yourself today.</font>

1457
01:03:25,400 --> 01:03:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been quiet.</font>

1458
01:03:27,520 --> 01:03:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

1459
01:03:31,040 --> 01:03:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know how I talked to her earlier?</font>

1460
01:03:34,240 --> 01:03:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really serious about it.</font>

1461
01:03:35,560 --> 01:03:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I came on too strong</font>

1462
01:03:37,320 --> 01:03:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and scared her.</font>

1463
01:03:40,240 --> 01:03:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our interests,</font>

1464
01:03:41,760 --> 01:03:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our habits and values...</font>

1465
01:03:43,320 --> 01:03:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're all so different.</font>

1466
01:03:44,200 --> 01:03:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With every relationship I've been in,</font>

1467
01:03:45,520 --> 01:03:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could see a future.</font>

1468
01:03:47,360 --> 01:03:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Marriage was a possibility.</font>

1469
01:03:49,160 --> 01:03:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's when I'm willing to go for it.</font>

1470
01:03:51,240 --> 01:03:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think for me</font>

1471
01:03:52,680 --> 01:03:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's a little different.</font>

1472
01:03:54,160 --> 01:03:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a healthy relationship,</font>

1473
01:03:56,320 --> 01:03:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to see a future too.</font>

1474
01:03:58,360 --> 01:04:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for this experience,</font>

1475
01:04:00,240 --> 01:04:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't been thinking,</font>

1476
01:04:02,120 --> 01:04:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I like this person,</font>

1477
01:04:03,480 --> 01:04:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I need something to come of it."</font>

1478
01:04:05,240 --> 01:04:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I like you a little,</font>

1479
01:04:08,410 --> 01:04:10,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just spend more time with you.</font>

1480
01:04:11,650 --> 01:04:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still like her?</font>

1481
01:04:13,250 --> 01:04:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you still have fun together?</font>

1482
01:04:14,810 --> 01:04:15,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's enough for now.</font>

1483
01:04:15,890 --> 01:04:17,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can hang out with her.</font>

1484
01:04:17,210 --> 01:04:20,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just afraid she'll get the wrong idea.</font>

1485
01:04:20,970 --> 01:04:22,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then tell her that directly.</font>

1486
01:04:22,450 --> 01:04:23,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could hang out with her...</font>

1487
01:04:23,410 --> 01:04:26,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Just as friends]
We could hang out as friends.</font>

1488
01:04:26,410 --> 01:04:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now, you two</font>

1489
01:04:27,170 --> 01:04:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't need to define the relationship.</font>

1490
01:04:29,090 --> 01:04:30,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On this island,</font>

1491
01:04:30,650 --> 01:04:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">relationships and roles</font>

1492
01:04:33,250 --> 01:04:34,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">keep changing.</font>

1493
01:04:35,330 --> 01:04:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing's set in stone.</font>

1494
01:04:36,290 --> 01:04:36,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

1495
01:04:36,930 --> 01:04:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nobody here has</font>

1496
01:04:37,810 --> 01:04:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">put a label on what you two are.</font>

1497
01:04:40,090 --> 01:04:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know I'm like this.</font>

1498
01:04:43,010 --> 01:04:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always want to give things...</font>

1499
01:04:45,850 --> 01:04:47,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't try to define it.</font>

1500
01:04:47,490 --> 01:04:48,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. Put a label on it.</font>

1501
01:04:48,410 --> 01:04:49,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't insist everything has to fit a box.</font>

1502
01:04:49,930 --> 01:04:50,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too messy.</font>

1503
01:04:50,970 --> 01:04:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Wang Sheng and I are like that.</font>

1504
01:04:52,810 --> 01:04:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We want things to be clear-cut.</font>

1505
01:04:54,010 --> 01:04:54,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1506
01:04:54,970 --> 01:04:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything has to fit a box.</font>

1507
01:05:02,770 --> 01:05:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like that thing he did before.</font>

1508
01:05:04,090 --> 01:05:04,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He takes it seriously too.</font>

1509
01:05:04,930 --> 01:05:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For him, everything is one thing or the other.</font>

1510
01:05:06,490 --> 01:05:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, but I didn't get hurt.</font>

1511
01:05:08,730 --> 01:05:10,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's because you're you.</font>

1512
01:05:10,170 --> 01:05:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm talking about Ke'er.</font>

1513
01:05:11,570 --> 01:05:12,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're different.</font>

1514
01:05:12,450 --> 01:05:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Ke'er can understand that.</font>

1515
01:05:18,490 --> 01:05:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, man.</font>

1516
01:05:19,570 --> 01:05:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I change my mind all the time.</font>

1517
01:05:21,610 --> 01:05:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you see me feeling bad about it?</font>

1518
01:05:23,010 --> 01:05:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't.</font>

1519
01:05:26,410 --> 01:05:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's my girl.</font>

1520
01:05:27,770 --> 01:05:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besties.</font>

1521
01:05:37,690 --> 01:05:37,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1522
01:05:37,970 --> 01:05:41,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't put all that pressure on yourself.</font>

1523
01:05:49,010 --> 01:05:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to guess each other's starting score?</font>

1524
01:05:50,810 --> 01:05:51,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Guessing their starting spark scores]</font>

1525
01:05:51,690 --> 01:05:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is day 1 the default score?</font>

1526
01:05:54,010 --> 01:05:55,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then it keeps going down.</font>

1527
01:05:55,650 --> 01:05:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you can recharge every day.</font>

1528
01:05:57,610 --> 01:05:58,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1529
01:05:58,210 --> 01:05:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sleep and get some points back.</font>

1530
01:05:59,490 --> 01:06:01,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then do you get back</font>

1531
01:06:01,210 --> 01:06:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your default score?</font>

1532
01:06:04,370 --> 01:06:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

1533
01:06:06,010 --> 01:06:06,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not always sleep.</font>

1534
01:06:08,530 --> 01:06:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sleep heals me right up.</font>

1535
01:06:10,290 --> 01:06:12,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it that easy?</font>

1536
01:06:12,210 --> 01:06:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's talking with you.</font>

1537
01:06:14,050 --> 01:06:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The things we say to each other.</font>

1538
01:06:14,730 --> 01:06:15,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Talking with you recharges me]
It's our conversations</font>

1539
01:06:15,850 --> 01:06:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that really recharge me.</font>

1540
01:06:21,610 --> 01:06:23,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like hanging out today.</font>

1541
01:06:23,130 --> 01:06:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or, say,</font>

1542
01:06:24,570 --> 01:06:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we talked on the swing today.</font>

1543
01:06:27,490 --> 01:06:29,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That might've added 5 points.</font>

1544
01:06:30,450 --> 01:06:31,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can the score max out?</font>

1545
01:06:36,570 --> 01:06:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How high can it go?</font>

1546
01:06:38,930 --> 01:06:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happens when you max out?</font>

1547
01:06:40,530 --> 01:06:41,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You transform.</font>

1548
01:06:41,570 --> 01:06:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It triggers a critical hit.</font>

1549
01:06:45,450 --> 01:06:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A critical hit of love, okay?</font>

1550
01:06:49,210 --> 01:06:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll turn into your puppy, okay?</font>

1551
01:06:50,410 --> 01:06:52,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A critical hit of love?</font>

1552
01:06:52,170 --> 01:06:53,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've lost it.</font>

1553
01:06:53,290 --> 01:06:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done talking about this.</font>

1554
01:06:54,490 --> 01:06:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dying.</font>

1555
01:06:56,250 --> 01:06:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm out.</font>

1556
01:06:57,090 --> 01:06:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1557
01:06:58,130 --> 01:06:59,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Transformation unlocked.</font>

1558
01:06:59,370 --> 01:07:00,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A puppy can turn into...</font>

1559
01:07:00,890 --> 01:07:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A clingy puppy, then.</font>

1560
01:07:02,010 --> 01:07:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A big wolfdog.</font>

1561
01:07:03,330 --> 01:07:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Yang. I can turn into anything.</font>

1562
01:07:04,810 --> 01:07:07,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So a West Highland Terrier can become a Tibetan Mastiff?</font>

1563
01:07:07,770 --> 01:07:08,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Awoo!</font>

1564
01:07:13,450 --> 01:07:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want to do</font>

1565
01:07:14,410 --> 01:07:15,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once we're off the island,</font>

1566
01:07:15,450 --> 01:07:16,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we get the chance?</font>

1567
01:07:21,210 --> 01:07:22,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you thinking that far ahead?</font>

1568
01:07:22,650 --> 01:07:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, there's no way</font>

1569
01:07:23,610 --> 01:07:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're winning that chance.</font>

1570
01:07:24,490 --> 01:07:25,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And second, why are you so sure...</font>

1571
01:07:25,650 --> 01:07:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'd definitely pick me</font>

1572
01:07:26,810 --> 01:07:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'd definitely pick you?</font>

1573
01:07:40,370 --> 01:07:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That answer is really making me...</font>

1574
01:07:45,970 --> 01:07:46,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really making me...</font>

1575
01:07:48,690 --> 01:07:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Minus 1 point. Minus 1. Minus 1.</font>

1576
01:07:50,930 --> 01:07:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Minus 1. Minus 1.</font>

1577
01:07:56,530 --> 01:07:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I put it?</font>

1578
01:07:57,610 --> 01:07:59,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An off-island date is a big deal.</font>

1579
01:07:59,610 --> 01:08:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd want to pick the right partner.</font>

1580
01:08:03,690 --> 01:08:03,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1581
01:08:06,090 --> 01:08:07,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you pick me without hesitation</font>

1582
01:08:07,610 --> 01:08:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you got the chance?</font>

1583
01:08:13,650 --> 01:08:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Silence]</font>

1584
01:08:19,370 --> 01:08:19,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Asking again]
Well?</font>

1585
01:08:21,290 --> 01:08:22,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you pick me without hesitation?</font>

1586
01:08:27,850 --> 01:08:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're dodging my question again.</font>

1587
01:08:28,690 --> 01:08:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always avoid</font>

1588
01:08:30,250 --> 01:08:32,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">answering the big questions.</font>

1589
01:08:33,730 --> 01:08:34,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't expect me</font>

1590
01:08:34,410 --> 01:08:35,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to decide the future today.</font>

1591
01:08:37,210 --> 01:08:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So right now,</font>

1592
01:08:38,090 --> 01:08:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're not ready to say you'd pick me.</font>

1593
01:08:40,010 --> 01:08:40,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1594
01:08:45,410 --> 01:08:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So does that mean</font>

1595
01:08:46,810 --> 01:08:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's two guys competing for one girl?</font>

1596
01:08:49,490 --> 01:08:51,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I can't be bothered competing.</font>

1597
01:08:51,210 --> 01:08:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to fight over anyone.</font>

1598
01:08:52,290 --> 01:08:54,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never fought over anything.</font>

1599
01:08:54,130 --> 01:08:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So are you...</font>

1600
01:08:55,050 --> 01:08:56,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you the type who,</font>

1601
01:08:56,410 --> 01:08:57,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if someone competes with you,</font>

1602
01:08:57,450 --> 01:08:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just steps aside?</font>

1603
01:09:01,770 --> 01:09:03,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It depends on how she reacts</font>

1604
01:09:03,890 --> 01:09:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the situation, you know?</font>

1605
01:09:05,090 --> 01:09:05,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If...</font>

1606
01:09:05,610 --> 01:09:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she reacts the way she is now,</font>

1607
01:09:07,410 --> 01:09:08,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll step aside.</font>

1608
01:09:08,930 --> 01:09:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hate</font>

1609
01:09:10,250 --> 01:09:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">snatching things out of people's mouths.</font>

1610
01:09:12,570 --> 01:09:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't stand it.</font>

1611
01:09:18,660 --> 01:09:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you like someone who's sure from day one,</font>

1612
01:09:20,780 --> 01:09:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or someone who</font>

1613
01:09:21,900 --> 01:09:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">goes through a lot,</font>

1614
01:09:23,940 --> 01:09:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">figures things out,</font>

1615
01:09:25,660 --> 01:09:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and only then</font>

1616
01:09:26,540 --> 01:09:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes a choice?</font>

1617
01:09:31,580 --> 01:09:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which choice feels more sincere to you?</font>

1618
01:09:33,940 --> 01:09:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think both can be sincere.</font>

1619
01:09:35,420 --> 01:09:37,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has their own way</font>

1620
01:09:37,500 --> 01:09:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of getting to know people,</font>

1621
01:09:40,620 --> 01:09:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and their own pace.</font>

1622
01:09:43,340 --> 01:09:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a lot to think about,</font>

1623
01:09:44,900 --> 01:09:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I'm probably more like the second one.</font>

1624
01:09:48,180 --> 01:09:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So if I want to</font>

1625
01:09:49,420 --> 01:09:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make a different choice,</font>

1626
01:09:50,340 --> 01:09:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please respect that.</font>

1627
01:09:56,860 --> 01:09:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't tell you</font>

1628
01:09:57,620 --> 01:09:59,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I'll choose in the end.</font>

1629
01:10:00,260 --> 01:10:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1630
01:10:00,620 --> 01:10:02,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you really want to start</font>

1631
01:10:02,500 --> 01:10:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a relationship that lasts,</font>

1632
01:10:03,460 --> 01:10:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a lot more</font>

1633
01:10:05,660 --> 01:10:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to think about.</font>

1634
01:10:10,460 --> 01:10:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sound more sincere today.</font>

1635
01:10:12,460 --> 01:10:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those first couple of days...</font>

1636
01:10:13,300 --> 01:10:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? I guess I...</font>

1637
01:10:16,220 --> 01:10:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm always joking around,</font>

1638
01:10:18,420 --> 01:10:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and people take me as a joke.</font>

1639
01:10:19,620 --> 01:10:20,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never thought you were a joke.</font>

1640
01:10:20,740 --> 01:10:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I meant what I said then, okay?</font>

1641
01:10:23,180 --> 01:10:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

1642
01:10:24,740 --> 01:10:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1643
01:10:26,540 --> 01:10:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you seem more sincere today too.</font>

1644
01:10:28,900 --> 01:10:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm always sincere.</font>

1645
01:10:31,660 --> 01:10:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly,</font>

1646
01:10:32,700 --> 01:10:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the way we both look,</font>

1647
01:10:35,540 --> 01:10:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">neither of us has trouble</font>

1648
01:10:39,140 --> 01:10:40,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">meeting people in real life.</font>

1649
01:10:41,380 --> 01:10:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. If you're meeting that many people,</font>

1650
01:10:45,220 --> 01:10:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">opening up to every one of them right away</font>

1651
01:10:48,660 --> 01:10:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seems pretty foolish to me.</font>

1652
01:10:51,340 --> 01:10:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It just does.</font>

1653
01:10:53,500 --> 01:10:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I first meet someone,</font>

1654
01:10:56,300 --> 01:10:58,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tend to keep my guard up.</font>

1655
01:11:05,780 --> 01:11:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today I gave</font>

1656
01:11:07,340 --> 01:11:09,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang to Liu Yuning: 4]
Liu Yuning 4 Moonstones.</font>

1657
01:11:09,020 --> 01:11:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't give her all of them</font>

1658
01:11:11,700 --> 01:11:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we still have room</font>

1659
01:11:15,380 --> 01:11:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get to know each other better.</font>

1660
01:11:20,740 --> 01:11:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she likes my face</font>

1661
01:11:21,620 --> 01:11:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Yang's personality.</font>

1662
01:11:22,900 --> 01:11:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who do you think she'd rather spend time with?</font>

1663
01:11:25,100 --> 01:11:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

1664
01:11:25,460 --> 01:11:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that would hurt</font>

1665
01:11:26,060 --> 01:11:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang?</font>

1666
01:11:26,580 --> 01:11:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think she was dodging the question.</font>

1667
01:11:29,420 --> 01:11:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. If she likes Yang more</font>

1668
01:11:31,460 --> 01:11:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">out of the two of us,</font>

1669
01:11:32,620 --> 01:11:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's still a rough thing for him to hear.</font>

1670
01:11:34,140 --> 01:11:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't want to embarrass either of you.</font>

1671
01:11:35,540 --> 01:11:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I think</font>

1672
01:11:36,460 --> 01:11:39,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was a pretty clever answer.</font>

1673
01:11:39,020 --> 01:11:40,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, very clever.</font>

1674
01:11:42,660 --> 01:11:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, you lose another 2 points today.</font>

1675
01:11:44,900 --> 01:11:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why? What did I do?</font>

1676
01:11:46,420 --> 01:11:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said I don't look like your ideal guy.</font>

1677
01:11:48,820 --> 01:11:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Points off.</font>

1678
01:11:50,860 --> 01:11:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First time ever</font>

1679
01:11:51,860 --> 01:11:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've lost on looks.</font>

1680
01:11:54,580 --> 01:11:55,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't mean</font>

1681
01:11:55,540 --> 01:11:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you aren't handsome.</font>

1682
01:11:58,660 --> 01:12:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really are handsome.</font>

1683
01:12:00,460 --> 01:12:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang...</font>

1684
01:12:01,100 --> 01:12:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you're handsome in a way</font>

1685
01:12:04,940 --> 01:12:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that makes you seem a little out of reach.</font>

1686
01:12:06,580 --> 01:12:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that make sense?</font>

1687
01:12:08,020 --> 01:12:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not really.</font>

1688
01:12:09,780 --> 01:12:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe you're just too handsome.</font>

1689
01:12:13,620 --> 01:12:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you're the kind of handsome</font>

1690
01:12:16,100 --> 01:12:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone notices right away.</font>

1691
01:12:18,420 --> 01:12:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like someone with</font>

1692
01:12:22,620 --> 01:12:26,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a little more life experience,</font>

1693
01:12:29,660 --> 01:12:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who seems a bit more mature.</font>

1694
01:12:32,060 --> 01:12:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a bit.</font>

1695
01:12:36,100 --> 01:12:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got this youthful energy.</font>

1696
01:12:39,380 --> 01:12:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I had to compare you to something,</font>

1697
01:12:41,700 --> 01:12:42,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're like</font>

1698
01:12:43,860 --> 01:12:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a piece of uncut jade.</font>

1699
01:12:45,700 --> 01:12:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing, though,</font>

1700
01:12:46,940 --> 01:12:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is more like a red wine.</font>

1701
01:12:49,220 --> 01:12:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how I'd put it.</font>

1702
01:12:50,180 --> 01:12:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two different types.</font>

1703
01:12:54,620 --> 01:12:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if we're only judging looks,</font>

1704
01:12:57,020 --> 01:12:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no contest.</font>

1705
01:12:59,140 --> 01:13:00,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1706
01:13:00,340 --> 01:13:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've crossed it out for you.</font>

1707
01:13:02,740 --> 01:13:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take back the penalty.</font>

1708
01:13:04,300 --> 01:13:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm happy now. Penalty reversed.</font>

1709
01:13:07,740 --> 01:13:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

1710
01:13:17,580 --> 01:13:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning to Huang Siyang: 3 Moonstones]</font>

1711
01:13:18,340 --> 01:13:19,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The things Yang did</font>

1712
01:13:19,260 --> 01:13:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really earned him points with me.</font>

1713
01:13:20,340 --> 01:13:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I had a fever,</font>

1714
01:13:21,940 --> 01:13:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he came to see me in my room.</font>

1715
01:13:24,780 --> 01:13:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He boiled water for me.</font>

1716
01:13:26,540 --> 01:13:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I brought some.</font>

1717
01:13:27,420 --> 01:13:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is hot water.</font>

1718
01:13:28,660 --> 01:13:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He brought me fruit too.</font>

1719
01:13:30,700 --> 01:13:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it sweet?</font>

1720
01:13:31,420 --> 01:13:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That night,</font>

1721
01:13:31,900 --> 01:13:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was starving,</font>

1722
01:13:32,740 --> 01:13:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we went to the dining room.</font>

1723
01:13:33,740 --> 01:13:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He stayed by my side the whole time.</font>

1724
01:13:36,100 --> 01:13:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang,</font>

1725
01:13:36,420 --> 01:13:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you make me</font>

1726
01:13:37,820 --> 01:13:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really good instant noodles today,</font>

1727
01:13:38,420 --> 01:13:39,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you</font>

1728
01:13:41,380 --> 01:13:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">6 extra points.</font>

1729
01:13:43,140 --> 01:13:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smells so good.</font>

1730
01:13:44,300 --> 01:13:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang, you're amazing.</font>

1731
01:13:46,500 --> 01:13:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because you're here.</font>

1732
01:13:48,100 --> 01:13:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Having him there and looking after me</font>

1733
01:13:50,500 --> 01:13:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made me feel like he was quietly</font>

1734
01:13:53,460 --> 01:13:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">paying attention and taking care of me.</font>

1735
01:13:55,900 --> 01:13:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really touched.</font>

1736
01:13:57,660 --> 01:13:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'll give him</font>

1737
01:13:59,740 --> 01:14:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bit more of my affection.</font>

1738
01:14:05,900 --> 01:14:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning to Wang Tianqing: 2 Moonstones]</font>

1739
01:14:08,740 --> 01:14:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Wang Tianqing cares about me too.</font>

1740
01:14:11,140 --> 01:14:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just doesn't know how to put it into words.</font>

1741
01:14:13,860 --> 01:14:14,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to spend more time</font>

1742
01:14:14,740 --> 01:14:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">getting to know him.</font>

1743
01:14:15,940 --> 01:14:18,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe he'll let his guard down too.</font>

1744
01:14:18,060 --> 01:14:20,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to make up my mind too quickly.</font>

1745
01:14:21,180 --> 01:14:23,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take my time</font>

1746
01:14:23,190 --> 01:14:24,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and see where my feelings go.</font>

1747
01:14:27,430 --> 01:14:28,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not knowing who to ask out here</font>

1748
01:14:28,990 --> 01:14:30,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is honestly a scary feeling.</font>

1749
01:14:30,670 --> 01:14:32,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's like you've lost</font>

1750
01:14:32,150 --> 01:14:33,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your whole purpose in life.</font>

1751
01:14:34,390 --> 01:14:36,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day she touched my nose.</font>

1752
01:14:36,430 --> 01:14:38,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Partner: Liu Xinran]
She happened to be my partner that day.</font>

1753
01:14:38,230 --> 01:14:39,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought that took guts.</font>

1754
01:14:39,950 --> 01:14:40,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From where I was standing,</font>

1755
01:14:40,870 --> 01:14:41,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it felt really brave of her.</font>

1756
01:14:41,830 --> 01:14:42,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because</font>

1757
01:14:42,350 --> 01:14:43,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally was right there.</font>

1758
01:14:43,910 --> 01:14:44,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She basically did it</font>

1759
01:14:44,950 --> 01:14:45,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right in front of Ally.</font>

1760
01:14:45,950 --> 01:14:47,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also gave her 2 Moonstones.</font>

1761
01:14:49,190 --> 01:14:50,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really winged it with my Moonstones that night.</font>

1762
01:14:52,430 --> 01:14:54,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Tianqing to Qian Shihan: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1763
01:14:54,350 --> 01:14:55,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I planned to wing it.</font>

1764
01:14:55,990 --> 01:15:01,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cai Ziyi, Liu Xinran, Chen Shuyue: 1 Moonstone each]</font>

1765
01:15:01,870 --> 01:15:04,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1766
01:15:04,230 --> 01:15:06,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Putting all my feelings on one person...</font>

1767
01:15:06,870 --> 01:15:09,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I need to let that go.</font>

1768
01:15:09,150 --> 01:15:11,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chasing her all the time</font>

1769
01:15:11,030 --> 01:15:12,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">puts a lot of pressure on me</font>

1770
01:15:12,350 --> 01:15:13,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a lot on her.</font>

1771
01:15:13,670 --> 01:15:16,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can take it a little easier,</font>

1772
01:15:16,070 --> 01:15:17,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">talk to other people too.</font>

1773
01:15:17,910 --> 01:15:19,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's better for me.</font>

1774
01:15:26,590 --> 01:15:27,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we're good now?</font>

1775
01:15:27,350 --> 01:15:27,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're good.</font>

1776
01:15:27,950 --> 01:15:30,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[They made up]
You've got to fight for love.</font>

1777
01:15:30,350 --> 01:15:31,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's the Qixi Festival.</font>

1778
01:15:31,710 --> 01:15:32,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It's the Qixi Festival]
Really?</font>

1779
01:15:32,830 --> 01:15:35,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to be myself again.</font>

1780
01:15:35,710 --> 01:15:37,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might lean more toward...</font>

1781
01:15:37,950 --> 01:15:39,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I should make a move too.</font>

1782
01:15:39,710 --> 01:15:40,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Makes the first move]
I'll make the first move for once.</font>

1783
01:15:40,950 --> 01:15:42,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her get to know me better.</font>

1784
01:15:42,710 --> 01:15:44,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tianqing's pretty funny]
Turn down guys you're not into.</font>

1785
01:15:44,470 --> 01:15:46,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing's pretty funny.</font>

1786
01:15:46,190 --> 01:15:47,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were supposed to be the bombshells.</font>

1787
01:15:47,910 --> 01:15:49,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want to know the real you.</font>

1788
01:15:49,750 --> 01:15:51,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was a massive shock.</font>

1789
01:15:51,670 --> 01:15:52,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Something steady]
This time it feels like it will last.</font>

1790
01:15:52,990 --> 01:15:54,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's steady now.</font>

1791
01:15:54,030 --> 01:15:55,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're done testing the waters.</font>

1792
01:15:55,110 --> 01:15:56,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just hang out as friends.</font>

1793
01:15:56,110 --> 01:15:57,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Just as friends]
I hope everyone here</font>

1794
01:15:57,510 --> 01:15:59,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gets to stay on the island</font>

1795
01:15:59,350 --> 01:16:01,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for all 13 days.</font>

1796
01:16:01,110 --> 01:16:02,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, some islanders</font>

1797
01:16:02,750 --> 01:16:04,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will have to say goodbye to the island.</font>

1798
01:16:09,470 --> 01:16:09,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Next episode]</font>

1799
01:16:09,710 --> 01:16:12,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone's leaving the island early today.</font>

1800
01:16:12,910 --> 01:16:14,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'd be such a shame to leave today.</font>

1801
01:16:14,190 --> 01:16:15,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you miss me if I left?</font>

1802
01:16:15,750 --> 01:16:17,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you leave?</font>

1803
01:16:17,350 --> 01:16:18,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My whole body feels weak.</font>

1804
01:16:18,590 --> 01:16:19,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is something on your mind?</font>

1805
01:16:19,590 --> 01:16:20,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing's wrong.</font>

1806
01:16:20,350 --> 01:16:22,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just need a little time.</font>

1807
01:16:24,270 --> 01:16:26,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[30 million spark scores]
Perfect. I might hit 30 million today.</font>

1808
01:16:26,390 --> 01:16:27,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's got a lot of charm.</font>

1809
01:16:27,590 --> 01:16:29,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't get a word in with them.</font>

1810
01:16:29,350 --> 01:16:30,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a little tired.</font>

1811
01:16:30,150 --> 01:16:31,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm emotionally drained.</font>

1812
01:16:31,110 --> 01:16:32,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want anyone bothering me.</font>

1813
01:16:33,190 --> 01:16:35,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's about first impressions,</font>

1814
01:16:35,190 --> 01:16:37,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd probably lean toward you.</font>

1815
01:16:37,430 --> 01:16:38,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Drawn to you at first sight]</font>

1816
01:16:38,790 --> 01:16:39,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianqing, want a bite?</font>

1817
01:16:40,510 --> 01:16:41,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to help Tianqing.</font>

1818
01:16:41,990 --> 01:16:42,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're too much.</font>

1819
01:16:42,870 --> 01:16:44,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you're asking me?</font>

1820
01:16:44,310 --> 01:16:47,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you like both sunshine and the sea?</font>

1821
01:16:47,310 --> 01:16:48,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want too much.</font>

1822
01:16:49,870 --> 01:16:51,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

1823
01:16:51,550 --> 01:16:52,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every day's been eventful.</font>

1824
01:16:52,870 --> 01:16:53,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many ups and downs.</font>

1825
01:16:54,070 --> 01:16:55,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to go for a ride at sunset?</font>

1826
01:16:55,870 --> 01:16:57,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. I've been waiting for you.</font>

1827
01:16:58,550 --> 01:17:00,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I can't sleep,</font>

1828
01:17:00,110 --> 01:17:01,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can I come talk to you?</font>

1829
01:17:01,950 --> 01:17:02,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

1830
01:17:04,030 --> 01:17:05,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy Qixi, everyone.</font>

1831
01:17:05,070 --> 01:17:05,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy Qixi.</font>

1832
01:17:07,350 --> 01:17:09,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a good time.</font>

1833
01:17:14,590 --> 01:17:15,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Affection Diary preview]
I'm really looking forward to it.</font>

1834
01:17:15,470 --> 01:17:17,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been waiting for this for ages.</font>

1835
01:17:17,990 --> 01:17:19,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here we go.</font>

1836
01:17:19,030 --> 01:17:19,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're watching ourselves?</font>

1837
01:17:19,790 --> 01:17:20,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm about to cry.</font>

1838
01:17:20,670 --> 01:17:21,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is so awkward.</font>

1839
01:17:21,110 --> 01:17:21,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to cry.</font>

1840
01:17:22,830 --> 01:17:24,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so awkward watching yourself.</font>

1841
01:17:28,230 --> 01:17:29,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't you have said that at the start?</font>

1842
01:17:29,950 --> 01:17:31,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why say it now?</font>

1843
01:17:31,390 --> 01:17:32,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wants to disappear]
Good to know.</font>

1844
01:17:33,310 --> 01:17:33,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lesson learned.</font>

1845
01:17:33,830 --> 01:17:35,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why so shy, Wang Sheng?</font>

1846
01:17:35,030 --> 01:17:35,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty girls make me nervous.</font>

1847
01:17:35,870 --> 01:17:36,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Two goofballs]
Two goofballs.</font>

1848
01:17:36,590 --> 01:17:37,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at them together.</font>

1849
01:17:37,910 --> 01:17:39,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did that feel? Tell us.</font>

1850
01:17:39,590 --> 01:17:41,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's grinding his teeth to dust.</font>

1851
01:17:42,310 --> 01:17:43,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did that make the cut?</font>

1852
01:17:43,830 --> 01:17:44,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we're done here,</font>

1853
01:17:44,630 --> 01:17:45,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">set up an octagon for us, okay?</font>

1854
01:17:45,910 --> 01:17:46,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Round 1]</font>

1855
01:17:46,470 --> 01:17:48,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Round 2]
Get us an octagon too.</font>

1856
01:17:48,830 --> 01:17:50,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The brokenhearted club.</font>

1857
01:17:53,270 --> 01:17:54,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean, more fun?</font>

1858
01:17:54,710 --> 01:17:56,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if they all just want to be friends?</font>

1859
01:17:57,230 --> 01:17:58,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm getting mad just hearing this.</font>

1860
01:17:58,830 --> 01:18:00,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hanging on every word]
He's going to come for me.</font>

1861
01:18:00,190 --> 01:18:01,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was a little upset at the time.</font>

1862
01:18:01,070 --> 01:18:01,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

1863
01:18:01,470 --> 01:18:02,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Just messing around]
It was actually pretty good.</font>

1864
01:18:02,310 --> 01:18:03,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was a little dazed at the time.</font>

1865
01:18:03,190 --> 01:18:04,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you saying hi for?</font>

1866
01:18:04,070 --> 01:18:05,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could tell right away</font>

1867
01:18:05,950 --> 01:18:06,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where Yang</font>

1868
01:18:06,270 --> 01:18:07,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was looking.</font>

1869
01:18:07,630 --> 01:18:08,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I took one look</font>

1870
01:18:08,790 --> 01:18:09,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wanted to go back.</font>
